    "title": "Who is NASA chief Jared Isaacman",
    "text": "SPACEWho is NASA chief Jared IsaacmanJared Isaacman, a billionaire pioneer of private space travel, was confirmed last month as NASA's 15th administrator. C. A. BridgesFlorida TodayUpdated Jan. 13, 2026, 8:45 p.m. ETJared Isaacman, a billionaire pioneer of private space travel, was confirmed last month as NASA's 15th administrator.As NASA head, Isaacman replaces Bill Nelson, who grew up on the Space Coast and graduated from Melbourne High School. Nelson has served as NASA administrator since April 2021.Who is Jared Isaacman?Jared Taylor Isaacman, 41, has been reaching for the stars in one way or another since high school in Bernards Township, New Jersey, where he and a friend created a company designing websites for local businesses.",
